# Keep README.md in sync with agent behavior

`README.md` is the developer-facing business spec for company mapping. After any change to matching, classify, search, LLM, Excel, prompts, config, or sample data, update `README.md` in the same change.

Follow `.cursor/skills/update-agent-logic-readme/SKILL.md`. Do not finish a behavior change with a stale README.
